UnitClPoolTape::GetSurroundingObservations
├── when the target is gte the newest committed observation
│   └── it returns the newest committed observation and the accumulator as an observation
└── when the target is lt the newest committed observation
    ├── when the target is lte the oldest observation
    │   └── it returns the oldest observation as both bounds
    └── when the target is within the committed range
        ├── when the target matches a committed observation
        │   └── it returns the matching observation as one of the bounds
        └── when the target is strictly between two committed observations
            └── it returns the two surrounding observations
